1. **Patent Notice**: The underlying Architecture and novel execution primitives implemented in this Software are strictly protected under **Republic of Korea Patent Application No. 10-2026-0179765** ("In-Context Virtual Machine System, Operating System, and Verification Method for Deterministic Autonomous AI Agents") and associated international priority filings.
2. **Commercial Reservation**: **No commercial license is granted under this License.** Any Commercial Use requires a separate, explicit, written commercial licensing agreement executed directly with the Author.
3. **Evaluation Grace Period**: Bona fide internal non-production technical evaluation by commercial entities is permitted for a period not exceeding thirty (30) consecutive calendar days, after which a commercial license must be secured or all deployments permanently decommissioned.

